e_admin":false},"body":"- First commit enables screen orientation change on large screens devices like foldables, tablets, chromebooks.\r\n    - It's already enabled forcefully on large devices running Android 16 or higher because those [ignore orientation locks](https://developer.android.com/about/versions/16/behavior-changes-16#ignore-orientation). So, we are now allowing orientation change on all large devices, according to some testings, editor is usable in portrait in these form factors.\r\n\r\n- Second commit enables in Project Manager on all devices, fix the `DisplayServer.screen_get_scale()` logic for portrait, and optimizes Project manager for compact layout\r\n    - Hides the Project Manager's side panel when the window is not wide enough. All the panel options are still accessible via right-click context menu.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/464f3f08-4371-4569-9947-f267f1b215ec\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/89dc78a6-284b-42ca-8e73-4ccf9f144371\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengin